Explore Siyam World and its stunning facilities, plan your visit and activities from your device before and during your visit. Use this app to start planning your stay, and ensure you don’t miss-out on any of the incredible experiences on offer at Siyam World Maldives. During your stay the app provides the perfect travel companion, showing what’s on, providing you with fantastic inspiration from the recommended bucket list experiences which you can book directly from the app.  Your itinerary is always accessible to see what adventures you have planned.  
A personal concierge in your pocket!
About the Resort:
Siyam World is a striking new vision of the Maldives’ rich natural wonders, a carefree playground with an exciting, diverse, and endless array of ‘never-seen-before’ experiences to bask in a WOW! Premium All-Inclusive island getaway that crosses cultures and borders. Designed for fun-loving, open-minded couples, romance seekers, families or larger groups of friends, with the freedom to roam, socialise and engage in an island community. Siyam World is one of the largest islands in the Maldives to boast a resort and show-stopping residences - The Beach House Collection.


Use the app to help:
- Explore the services and facilities available at the resort;
- Perfect your stay by booking restaurant tables, excursions and activities such as snorkelling, scuba diving or spa treatments;
- view the entertainment schedule for the upcoming week;
- request to book any special events that you’d like to arrange for a loved one;
- book your next stay at the resort.

GAL trans is a Moldovan carrier company that operates regular bus services from Moldova to Romania, Ukraine and Russia.

With the application from GAL Trans you can easily:
– choose a flight suitable for the requested date;
– check buses routes on the map;
– see buses’ photos;
– make a reservation with payment to the driver during the boarding;
– pay for the ticket online;
– get access to the history of all purchased tickets in the personal account
– make a quick ticket return in your personal account
– request information from support service.

GAL Trans has a large bus fleet that meets European standards.

The professional drivers team will make sure that your trip is as comfortable as possible.

GAL Trans - it's important, who you travel with!

OsmAnd is an offline world map application based on OpenStreetMap (OSM), which allows you to navigate taking into account the preferred roads and vehicle dimensions. Plan routes based on inclines and record GPX tracks without an internet connection.
OsmAnd is an open source app. We do not collect user data and you decide what data the app will have access to.

Main features:

Map view
• Choice of places to be displayed on the map: attractions, food, health and more;
• Search for places by address, name, coordinates, or category;
• Map styles for the convenience of different activities: touring view, nautical map, winter and ski, topographic, desert, off-road, and others;
• Shading relief and plug-in contour lines;
• Ability to overlay different sources of maps on top of each other;

GPS Navigation
• Plotting a route to a place without an Internet connection;
• Customizable navigation profiles for different vehicles: cars, motorcycles, bicycles, 4x4, pedestrians, boats, public transport, and more;
• Change the constructed route, taking into account the exclusion of certain roads or road surfaces;
• Customizable information widgets about the route: distance, speed, remaining travel time, distance to turn, and more;

Route Planning and Recording
• Plotting a route point by point using one or multiple navigation profiles;
• Route recording using GPX tracks;
• Manage GPX tracks: displaying your own or imported GPX tracks on the map, navigating through them;
• Visual data about the route - descents/ascents, distances;
• Ability to share GPX track in OpenStreetMap;

Creation of points with different functionality
• Favourites;
• Markers;

OpenStreetMap
• Making edits to OSM;
• Updating maps with a frequency of up to one hour;

Additional features
• Compass and radius ruler;
• Mapillary interface;
• Night theme;
• Large community of users around the world, documentation, and support;


Paid features:


OsmAnd Maps+ (in-app or subscription):
• Unlimited map downloads;
• Topo data (Contour lines and Terrain);
• Nautical depths;
• Offline Wikipedia;
• Apple CarPlay support;

OsmAnd Pro (subscription):
• All Maps+ features;
• Weather forecast on the map online/offline;
• OsmAnd Cloud (backup and restore);
• Customize Route line;
• Hourly map updates.

SIM8 – is an app for connecting to the best Internet networks abroad without an international SIM card and roaming. SIM8 – is a great solution to stay connected all over the world!
The app uses the smartphone’s built-in SIM card, eSIM. You can install it on iPhone XR, XS (Max) and 11 (Pro, Pro Max). The app itself is free – you only pay for the call plan you chose for traveling within a particular country or a group of countries and buy as many GB of Internet traffic as you need.

SIM8 is a good option both for those who go away for a holiday and those who often travel to other countries. Thanks to this app, the travelers don’t have to buy an international SIM-card or switch SIM cards of local providers every time. Don’t go to mobile-phone shops, don’t waste your time on learning about call plans and filling out paperwork to call a cab to the airport or text your loved ones on messengers (WhatsApp, Viber, Telegram, Skype, Facebook Messenger, Snapchat). Just install SIM8, activate a package you find suitable and enjoy reliable mobile Internet without roaming in such countries as:
●The USA;
●Canada;
●France;
●Brazil;
●Mexico;
●Great Britain;
●Germany;
●Italy;
●Russia;
●Turkey;
●Australia;

And other countries of North and South America, Asia and Africa.
SIM8 has similar terms of service for different countries, the only difference is the cost. In addition to a particular country or a group of countries, you can choose traffic volume and the period of service. SIM8 provides from 3 to 50-day packages and from 100 MB to 3 GB of Internet traffic. If you need the Internet access only to use the messengers, don’t overpay for roaming, use our unlimited plan «Stay online (messengers)».
4 reasons to choose SIM8:
1. Get connected to the Internet just in several minutes without buying a physical or a virtual SIM card, filling out paperwork and going to the mobile phone shops.
2. Pay for a chosen plan with the help of any banking card from anywhere in the world.
3. Going to another country? Choose another region for your plan just in a single click!
4. Have a stable connection no matter where you are and forget about roaming!

What do you need to use SIM8 packages?
1. To have a phone that supports eSIM;
2. To download and install our app on your smartphone;
3. To choose a country or a group of countries where you will need an Internet connection;
4. Pay online and activate a package by scanning a QR code that will be sent to the email address you specified when signing up.

SIM8 – stay connected all the time, all over the world!
